# MODULE 13 — AUTOMATIC CODEBASE INDEX REFRESH

The knowledge index must not become permanently outdated.

Design a reliable refresh mechanism using the facilities supported by the existing project.

Consider:

- Startup validation of index freshness.
- File fingerprints or content hashes.
- File-system watching in development, where supported.
- Git-based change detection.
- Targeted reindexing of modified files.
- Full reindexing when required.
- Explicit manual refresh.
- Index schema versioning.
- Failed-indexing recovery.
- Stale-index warnings.
